    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Adopt Animal Forms to Guard the Wilds</p></blockquote><p>Druids of the Circle of the Moon draw on lunar magic to transform themselves. Their order gathers under the moon to share news and perform rituals.</p><p>Changeable as the moon, a Druid of this circle might prowl as a great cat one night, soar over the treetops as an eagle the next day, and then crash through undergrowth as a bear to drive off a trespassing monster. The wild is in the Druid's blood.</p>",
